# Cursor AI Rules for LLM-EdgeFlow

Please strictly follow the development directives defined in `AGENTS.md` and `CLAUDE.md`.

## Key Commands
- Build: `mkdir -p build && cd build && cmake .. && make -j4`
- Format: `./scripts/format.sh`
- Test: `cd build && ctest --output-on-failure` && `./scripts/run_all_tests.sh`
- Branch & PR: `./scripts/git_branch_upload.sh "<msg>" "<type>"`

## Architecture
- Layer 1: Pure C ABI in `include/company_alg_interface.h` (pure C only, `noexcept` firewall).
- Layer 2: Dynamic blackboard `AlgContext` and `Pipeline`.
- Layer 3: Nodes inheriting `INode` + `REGISTER_NODE`.
- Layer 4: Heterogeneous engines with `FixedBatchExecutor`.
- All third-party dependencies must be fetched via CMake `FetchContent`.
